# Local settings now live only in the repository ROOT .env.
# Copy ../.env.example to ../.env. Vite exposes only the public settings it needs.
# Separate frontend hosting also accepts VITE_API_BASE_URL,
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY as platform variables.
# Never put database or privileged Supabase credentials in frontend variables.
